(7077337, 1076847, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m not 100% sure a sidewalk in the rain is a good place to find a bear, but it''s certainly as good a place as any to start a quest for his spirit. May the leash lead you to the light :-)</td>', 'I''m not 100% sure a sidewalk in the rain is a good place to find a bear, but it''s certainly as good a place as any to start a quest for his spirit. May the leash lead you to the light :-)', '2013-07-26 10:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
