(7078106, 1076757, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nails my love of geometry combined with off-centeredness. Colors perfect. Except for the blue hat, and especially how it precisely bisects that corner. Still, you had no control over that. Lovely image!</td>', 'Nails my love of geometry combined with off-centeredness. Colors perfect. Except for the blue hat, and especially how it precisely bisects that corner. Still, you had no control over that. Lovely image!', '2013-07-28 15:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
