(7078264, 1076928, 108069, '<td valign="top">Funny. The eye works from top left in a reading motion (for we Westerners), so I read Grab Handle in large letters, and then Grab Handle again in bold in the explanation of what the Grab Handle is... and at this point I''m thinking this title sure as heck should be Grab Handle and tadaaa... Grab Handle! Nicely titled!<br/> <br/>Great tones, well composed and framed. Great photo from seemingly nothing.</td>', 'Funny. The eye works from top left in a reading motion (for we Westerners), so I read Grab Handle in large letters, and then Grab Handle again in bold in the explanation of what the Grab Handle is... and at this point I''m thinking this title sure as heck should be Grab Handle and tadaaa... Grab Handle! Nicely titled! Great tones, well composed and framed. Great photo from seemingly nothing.', '2013-07-29 00:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7078267, 1076850, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done. The entire image doesn''t do much for me, but I''m constantly drawn to the house framed by the bridge (as intended), and there''s a wonderful scene and many imagined stories there. It''s like the real photo is trapped inside another photo. Really interesting stuff.</td>', 'Cleverly done. The entire image doesn''t do much for me, but I''m constantly drawn to the house framed by the bridge (as intended), and there''s a wonderful scene and many imagined stories there. It''s like the real photo is trapped inside another photo. Really interesting stuff.', '2013-07-29 00:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7078268, 1076908, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff. A sort of evolution, or devolution. Love it.</td>', 'Excellent stuff. A sort of evolution, or devolution. Love it.', '2013-07-29 00:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
