(7078602, 1076782, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The one visible face in the far upper left is achingly unclear. It''s not a bear kind of picture, but it IS a bear sort of feeling being evoked, the sense of being lost in broad daylight, unnoticed and unheard.</td>', 'I like this very much. The one visible face in the far upper left is achingly unclear. It''s not a bear kind of picture, but it IS a bear sort of feeling being evoked, the sense of being lost in broad daylight, unnoticed and unheard.', '2013-07-29 19:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
