(7078605, 1076886, 30861, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary scene, striking composition. Something''s off about the processing, to my eye, there''s an artificial haloing where shapes meet blue, and the shadows of the pier aren''t fully expressed. I''d love to see the original. This could be absolute killer...</td>', 'Extraordinary scene, striking composition. Something''s off about the processing, to my eye, there''s an artificial haloing where shapes meet blue, and the shadows of the pier aren''t fully expressed. I''d love to see the original. This could be absolute killer...', '2013-07-29 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
