(7078607, 1076863, 30861, '<td valign="top">Such an odd sight. I wish it weren''t quite so gauzy but, heck, I go gauzy myself often enough so who am I to quibble?</td>', 'Such an odd sight. I wish it weren''t quite so gauzy but, heck, I go gauzy myself often enough so who am I to quibble?', '2013-07-29 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
