(7079920, 1076847, 11769, '<td valign="top">well on his way</td>', 'well on his way', '2013-08-01 10:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079921, 1076928, 11769, '<td valign="top">a lot of hands have pulled down on that lever, very human. well done</td>', 'a lot of hands have pulled down on that lever, very human. well done', '2013-08-01 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079932, 1076853, 74588, '<td valign="top">like the whole thing  9</td>', 'like the whole thing  9', '2013-08-01 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079956, 1076726, 104230, '<td valign="top">Congrats on reaching the 1,000th entry milestone, sweetie!</td>', 'Congrats on reaching the 1,000th entry milestone, sweetie!', '2013-08-01 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079960, 1076941, 96574, '<td valign="top">the contrasting colors in this really work nicely together.</td>', 'the contrasting colors in this really work nicely together.', '2013-08-01 12:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079961, 1076961, 96574, '<td valign="top">very beary.   the processing and mood are very bear-ish.</td>', 'very beary.   the processing and mood are very bear-ish.', '2013-08-01 12:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079983, 1076942, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely tones and shapes. balanced composition.</td>', 'lovely tones and shapes. balanced composition.', '2013-08-01 13:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079986, 1076960, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dodging and burning is overdone, but it does create an interesting, campy effect. I actually have a certain affection for this image. The campiness is justified by that marvelous woman holding something out for me. Maybe you could fix some of the haloing.... more easily said than done.</td>', 'the dodging and burning is overdone, but it does create an interesting, campy effect. I actually have a certain affection for this image. The campiness is justified by that marvelous woman holding something out for me. Maybe you could fix some of the haloing.... more easily said than done.', '2013-08-01 13:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079987, 1076958, 50695, '<td valign="top">BE/AR E<br/> <br/>existence... can you bear it?</td>', 'BE/AR E existence... can you bear it?', '2013-08-01 13:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079990, 1076712, 50695, '<td valign="top">some nice melodrama here, with the small characters overwhelmed by nature... reminds me of those Hudson School Romantics.</td>', 'some nice melodrama here, with the small characters overwhelmed by nature... reminds me of those Hudson School Romantics.', '2013-08-01 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079992, 1076894, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the misty yellow cast of this photo. It plays well with the monumental, balanced composition.</td>', 'I like the misty yellow cast of this photo. It plays well with the monumental, balanced composition.', '2013-08-01 13:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7079994, 1076911, 50695, '<td valign="top">subtle, soft, balanced. a very soft noise, softer than smoothness, which can be so cold. She is turned away not because she is cold, but because she is vulnerable and needs to protect herself. or she is simply being with herself and her thoughts quietly. yes, she is not reacting to the viewer at all. The viewer is reacting to her.</td>', 'subtle, soft, balanced. a very soft noise, softer than smoothness, which can be so cold. She is turned away not because she is cold, but because she is vulnerable and needs to protect herself. or she is simply being with herself and her thoughts quietly. yes, she is not reacting to the viewer at all. The viewer is reacting to her.', '2013-08-01 13:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080087, 1076958, 50641, '<td valign="top">very curious</td>', 'very curious', '2013-08-01 16:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080102, 1076757, 50695, '<td valign="top">good dynamic image. boldly off-balance composition. high contrast lighting. dynamic pose of someone both moving and carrying. acute angle POV. all good things, working together.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'good dynamic image. boldly off-balance composition. high contrast lighting. dynamic pose of someone both moving and carrying. acute angle POV. all good things, working together. I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave ', '2013-08-01 17:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080103, 1076908, 50695, '<td valign="top">intriguing composition, with small isolated elements distant from each other on two planes. the man in the water with what seems to be a cane adds some Surrealism to the mix. even though there is a horizon, it''s all the same color, so the background is rather flat, emphasizing the isolation of each element. good image.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'intriguing composition, with small isolated elements distant from each other on two planes. the man in the water with what seems to be a cane adds some Surrealism to the mix. even though there is a horizon, it''s all the same color, so the background is rather flat, emphasizing the isolation of each element. good image.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave ', '2013-08-01 17:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080104, 1076847, 50695, '<td valign="top">good dynamic motion capture. the composition is also dynamic, with its curved perspective, even though it''s also balanced. The seemingly random light squiggle in upper right actually balances the dog and leash. well done.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'good dynamic motion capture. the composition is also dynamic, with its curved perspective, even though it''s also balanced. The seemingly random light squiggle in upper right actually balances the dog and leash. well done.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave ', '2013-08-01 17:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080105, 1076794, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is not my kind of shot but I love it anyway. I think it''s because there''s almost no water in it. It''s all about texture and shape and pattern. Really beautiful.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'this is not my kind of shot but I love it anyway. I think it''s because there''s almost no water in it. It''s all about texture and shape and pattern. Really beautiful.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave ', '2013-08-01 17:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080106, 1076883, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautifully caught. It''s difficult to catch a tree in midflight.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'beautifully caught. It''s difficult to catch a tree in midflight.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave ', '2013-08-01 17:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080107, 1076926, 50695, '<td valign="top">leaves become geese. the darkness says so.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'leaves become geese. the darkness says so.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy bear cave ', '2013-08-01 17:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080108, 1076717, 50695, '<td valign="top">vulnerable<br/> <br/>or does this show defiance?<br/> <br/>you''ve taken some shortcuts to get directly to a real photo. I''m there.</td>', 'vulnerable or does this show defiance? you''ve taken some shortcuts to get directly to a real photo. I''m there.', '2013-08-01 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080113, 1076717, 28427, '<td valign="top">Strong!</td>', 'Strong!', '2013-08-01 17:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080147, 1076920, 147314, '<td valign="top">Love this image, the colours, the reflection...Beautiful!</td>', 'Love this image, the colours, the reflection...Beautiful!', '2013-08-01 18:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080148, 1076804, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colours, and good find as well!</td>', 'Great composition and colours, and good find as well!', '2013-08-01 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080149, 1076726, 147314, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing, especially the (light in the) sky is fabulous!</td>', 'I really like the processing, especially the (light in the) sky is fabulous!', '2013-08-01 18:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080171, 1076717, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extraordinary. In a quick once-over, easily the most powerful image in the challenge, and entirely in the spirit of me, at least as I view myself and my relationship to life. Thanks for sharing it, brother Peter.<br/> <br/>******<br/> <br/>You are my Spirit Brother: I award you the Golden Bear Paw.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762723" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is extraordinary. In a quick once-over, easily the most powerful image in the challenge, and entirely in the spirit of me, at least as I view myself and my relationship to life. Thanks for sharing it, brother Peter. ****** You are my Spirit Brother: I award you the Golden Bear Paw. ', '2013-08-01 19:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080174, 1076804, 30861, '<td valign="top">It amazes me that there actually is a vocal opposition to this sculpture''s placement. It''s hard to understand people; I prefer being a Bear. The light is very much to my liking, the tone work is skillfully done.<br/> <br/>***************<br/> <br/>For your willingness to tackle extremes of light and your ability to make the tones work, a pursuit very much on my mind lately, I give you a Bronze Bear Paw.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762723" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It amazes me that there actually is a vocal opposition to this sculpture''s placement. It''s hard to understand people; I prefer being a Bear. The light is very much to my liking, the tone work is skillfully done. *************** For your willingness to tackle extremes of light and your ability to make the tones work, a pursuit very much on my mind lately, I give you a Bronze Bear Paw. ', '2013-08-01 19:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080177, 1076958, 30861, '<td valign="top">I tend to be a moving target: how dare you freeze me so? CUT me loose and let me OUT to run!<br/> <br/>*************<br/> <br/>For this strange capture and attempted assassination of my spirit, which, although it''s entirely unlike anything I''ve ever done (or attempted) resonates fiercely with me, I give you the Silver Bear Paw.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762724" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762724.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762724.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762724.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I tend to be a moving target: how dare you freeze me so? CUT me loose and let me OUT to run! ************* For this strange capture and attempted assassination of my spirit, which, although it''s entirely unlike anything I''ve ever done (or attempted) resonates fiercely with me, I give you the Silver Bear Paw. ', '2013-08-01 19:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080178, 1076908, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is curiously "me". I feel a great resonance with it, and it echoes but does not copy some themes I see in my work. Very well done.<br/> <br/>*******<br/> <br/>For the sheer strangeness of the thing, for the old man hobbling into the sea, for the heedless fishing boat on its way, and for the hunched water troll in the middle ground between reality and drowning, I give you a Bronze Bear Paw.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762725" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762725.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762725.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762725.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is curiously "me". I feel a great resonance with it, and it echoes but does not copy some themes I see in my work. Very well done. ******* For the sheer strangeness of the thing, for the old man hobbling into the sea, for the heedless fishing boat on its way, and for the hunched water troll in the middle ground between reality and drowning, I give you a Bronze Bear Paw. ', '2013-08-01 19:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080179, 1076883, 30861, '<td valign="top">It is? But... but... bears don''t fly! Do they? I wish I *could* escape that easily and cleanse myself in coldbright air.<br/> <br/>********<br/> <br/>I do keep coming back to it, and dreaming that I might fly one day. For the dream, and that I can dream it, I give you a Bronze Bear Paw.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762725" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762725.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762725.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762725.jpg"/></a></td>', 'It is? But... but... bears don''t fly! Do they? I wish I *could* escape that easily and cleanse myself in coldbright air. ******** I do keep coming back to it, and dreaming that I might fly one day. For the dream, and that I can dream it, I give you a Bronze Bear Paw. ', '2013-08-01 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080180, 1076931, 30861, '<td valign="top">At the end of the day a bear likes nothing more than a nosegay of sweet-smelling blooms to erase the stench of salmon from his sinuses. This Bear thanks you :-)</td>', 'At the end of the day a bear likes nothing more than a nosegay of sweet-smelling blooms to erase the stench of salmon from his sinuses. This Bear thanks you :-)', '2013-08-01 19:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080181, 1076763, 30861, '<td valign="top">You know, this one snuck by me on first pass. It''s been sitting here with a lonely 6 to its name, but when I look at it now, in commenting, I feel a resonance, a subtle one, that I didn''t before. Technically, it''s kind of got plusses and minuses, but who cares? A worthwhile image. Bumping you up. Thanks for the tree :-)</td>', 'You know, this one snuck by me on first pass. It''s been sitting here with a lonely 6 to its name, but when I look at it now, in commenting, I feel a resonance, a subtle one, that I didn''t before. Technically, it''s kind of got plusses and minuses, but who cares? A worthwhile image. Bumping you up. Thanks for the tree :-)', '2013-08-01 19:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080182, 1076924, 30861, '<td valign="top">So I''m a weathered, dying old tree in a patch of bracken, am I? Not far from the truth, actually :-)<br/> <br/>"Last night they drained the fluid from a knee<br/>and pumped a shoulder full of cortisone.<br/>Thus I conform to my divinity<br/>by dying inward, like an aging tree."<br/> <br/><i>Theodore Roethke</i></td>', 'So I''m a weathered, dying old tree in a patch of bracken, am I? Not far from the truth, actually :-) "Last night they drained the fluid from a kneeand pumped a shoulder full of cortisone.Thus I conform to my divinityby dying inward, like an aging tree." Theodore Roethke', '2013-08-01 19:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080183, 1076202, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure I recognize you, but I''m shy to say so because if I were wrong, which a Bear often is in these matters, I''d end up with egg on my face. But thanks for the smile, <i>ma belle</i>!</td>', 'I''m pretty sure I recognize you, but I''m shy to say so because if I were wrong, which a Bear often is in these matters, I''d end up with egg on my face. But thanks for the smile, ma belle!', '2013-08-01 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080185, 1076858, 30861, '<td valign="top">My kind of scene, no doubt about it. I live in places like that, though the shadows of my marshes tend to be more luminous, and the clouds tend to have more texture :-) Love the composition.</td>', 'My kind of scene, no doubt about it. I live in places like that, though the shadows of my marshes tend to be more luminous, and the clouds tend to have more texture :-) Love the composition.', '2013-08-01 19:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080186, 1076967, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a nice fuzzy bear there, for sure, a very appealing <strike>pair</strike> bear...</td>', 'Well, it''s a nice fuzzy bear there, for sure, a very appealing pair bear...', '2013-08-01 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080187, 1076850, 30861, '<td valign="top">That looks a whole lot like the bridge I stand on when I shoot my red-skiff location :-) Nice control of the tones.</td>', 'That looks a whole lot like the bridge I stand on when I shoot my red-skiff location :-) Nice control of the tones.', '2013-08-01 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080189, 1076854, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gloom! I feel gloom! Tattooed mothers! What''s the world coming to? Or maybe that isn''t a mother, it may be a rock-star-wannabe-guy? Why is Mr. Backpack glowering at me? Gloom, I tell you, gloom!</td>', 'Gloom! I feel gloom! Tattooed mothers! What''s the world coming to? Or maybe that isn''t a mother, it may be a rock-star-wannabe-guy? Why is Mr. Backpack glowering at me? Gloom, I tell you, gloom!', '2013-08-01 20:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080191, 1076920, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a fuzzy ducky fo'' shur. Thanks for the good wishes. Have you ever thought how nice a water pattern like that would look as a wrapping paper? Never mind me, I''m losing it...</td>', 'That''s a fuzzy ducky fo'' shur. Thanks for the good wishes. Have you ever thought how nice a water pattern like that would look as a wrapping paper? Never mind me, I''m losing it...', '2013-08-01 20:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080192, 1076949, 87808, '<td valign="top">I like the pop of colour!</td>', 'I like the pop of colour!', '2013-08-01 20:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080193, 1076961, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s so much to like here but holy moley, that yellow grass saturation is just screaming at me. The rest of it''s super. Love the Osprey/Fish Hawk. I could live in that house and under that glowering sky.</td>', 'There''s so much to like here but holy moley, that yellow grass saturation is just screaming at me. The rest of it''s super. Love the Osprey/Fish Hawk. I could live in that house and under that glowering sky.', '2013-08-01 20:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
