(7080203, 1076859, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful, and I like how you''ve done it, but at the same time the pastels seem almost weird. Still, I like it better now than I did on first pass, so bumpety-bump you go. I wish you''d leveled the horizon, though :-(</td>', 'This is really beautiful, and I like how you''ve done it, but at the same time the pastels seem almost weird. Still, I like it better now than I did on first pass, so bumpety-bump you go. I wish you''d leveled the horizon, though :-(', '2013-08-01 20:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
