(7080291, 1076942, 30861, '<td valign="top">Penny and her Bear are touched by the sentiment: it brings little teardrops of happiness to their respective visages, though Bear tries to be manly and hopes HIS tears will disappear among the runneled fur of his recent salmon-fishing expedition. Hey! Maybe we can train the gulls to get the salmons for us?</td>', 'Penny and her Bear are touched by the sentiment: it brings little teardrops of happiness to their respective visages, though Bear tries to be manly and hopes HIS tears will disappear among the runneled fur of his recent salmon-fishing expedition. Hey! Maybe we can train the gulls to get the salmons for us?', '2013-08-01 21:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
