(7080296, 1076525, 30861, '<td valign="top">Skiffs really, really like level horizons, ya know? Besides, that''s a sailboat, not a skiff. On the plus side, it''s RED and the scene is MARSHY, and a Bear thanks you for showing him your corner of the waterworld.</td>', 'Skiffs really, really like level horizons, ya know? Besides, that''s a sailboat, not a skiff. On the plus side, it''s RED and the scene is MARSHY, and a Bear thanks you for showing him your corner of the waterworld.', '2013-08-01 21:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
