(7080301, 1076791, 30861, '<td valign="top">This Bear was unaware that "lustre" could be pluralized, but then he assumes that whoever spells "luster" as "lustre" is a mother-speaker of the shared tongue, so he will cede the point and bask in the lustres (reflected, no less) on this very beguiling image which he just realized he had sorely under-rated and is now bumping from 5 to 7 :-)</td>', 'This Bear was unaware that "lustre" could be pluralized, but then he assumes that whoever spells "luster" as "lustre" is a mother-speaker of the shared tongue, so he will cede the point and bask in the lustres (reflected, no less) on this very beguiling image which he just realized he had sorely under-rated and is now bumping from 5 to 7 :-)', '2013-08-01 21:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080304, 1076531, 30861, '<td valign="top">You got the sunset part just great; the sky is beautifully-handled. The rest of it is rather humdrum, but you knew that, right? You just wanted to share your sky with a Bear, and he thanks you!</td>', 'You got the sunset part just great; the sky is beautifully-handled. The rest of it is rather humdrum, but you knew that, right? You just wanted to share your sky with a Bear, and he thanks you!', '2013-08-01 21:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080306, 1076776, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love old ships...But this is where a Bear begins to ruminate on the distinction between portholes and portlights, these probably being the latter because they can be opened :-)<br/> <br/>No matter, no matter! Thanks for taking me out to sea this lovely summer day.</td>', 'I love old ships...But this is where a Bear begins to ruminate on the distinction between portholes and portlights, these probably being the latter because they can be opened :-) No matter, no matter! Thanks for taking me out to sea this lovely summer day.', '2013-08-01 21:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080308, 1076918, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of perfection in this image: it''s crisp, the luminosity is well-handled, nothing''s overdone, and so forth. It seems a bit sterile to me, though, and it feels like the diagonal should be more pronounced. <br/> <br/>Still, I shouldn''t be critical when I actually DO appreciate very much that you made this with me in mind, and I thank you for it.</td>', 'There''s a lot of perfection in this image: it''s crisp, the luminosity is well-handled, nothing''s overdone, and so forth. It seems a bit sterile to me, though, and it feels like the diagonal should be more pronounced.  Still, I shouldn''t be critical when I actually DO appreciate very much that you made this with me in mind, and I thank you for it.', '2013-08-01 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
