(7080657, 1076908, 49018, '<td valign="top">I liked many of your images, but none as much as this one.<br/>It''s like Storm Thorgerson meeting intimate photography.<br/>I find it very moving.<br/>Sometimes is good to have little time and only one shot, if we put in all we have got, seemingly effortlessly.<br/>Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-08-02 06:09:33.</i></td>', 'I liked many of your images, but none as much as this one.It''s like Storm Thorgerson meeting intimate photography.I find it very moving.Sometimes is good to have little time and only one shot, if we put in all we have got, seemingly effortlessly.Well done.', '2013-08-02 07:06:03.000000', '2013-08-02 07:09:33.000000', 0);
