(7081789, 1076960, 124815, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot Allen. For what''s worth, i gave it 8 and did not have time for bump or comment.<br/> <br/>The other shots are outstanding also. The magical landscape (too post card-ish for me for a FS but amazing), the kids with their bird like shadows, the alphabet shot -a true FS and the horse, a classic.<br/>I don''t know how you can travel that much but you make the best of it and i would be delighted to see more.<br/>Your name is Armenian right?</td>', 'Fabulous shot Allen. For what''s worth, i gave it 8 and did not have time for bump or comment. The other shots are outstanding also. The magical landscape (too post card-ish for me for a FS but amazing), the kids with their bird like shadows, the alphabet shot -a true FS and the horse, a classic.I don''t know how you can travel that much but you make the best of it and i would be delighted to see more.Your name is Armenian right?', '2013-08-05 02:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
